    "lines": [
      "The performance of an item can be upgraded by visiting the",
      "aging master in Pillai with some sheltoms and money. An item",
      "can be aged 10 times and each successful aging gives the",
      "item a distinctive splendor. However, the chance of failure",
      "becomes higher after each aging, with a risk of losing",
      "sheltoms, money, and even the item itself.",
